  "问题与行动": "Issues & actions",
  "Y 轴装配涉及光轴、轴承、皮带和张紧等连续操作。反复对齐、定位不便或紧固顺序不清，会同时增加操作时间与装配波动。": "The Y-axis assembly involves consecutive operations on guide rods, bearings, belts and belt tensioning. Repeated alignment, awkward locating or an unclear fastening sequence can increase both task time and assembly variation.",
  "我拆分实际操作并记录工序衔接，结合定位、公差、紧固和工具配置分析重复调整的原因；再讨论任务重分配、定位治具、结构导入和扭矩标定等改善建议。": "I broke down the actual operations and recorded process handoffs, then examined locating, tolerances, fastening and tool setup to understand repeated adjustments. I also discussed recommendations such as task reallocation, locating fixtures, assembly lead-in features and torque calibration.",
