  "装配动作、工位衔接与标准作业": "Assembly Tasks, Handoffs & Standard Work",
  "以 Y 轴子组件为具体对象，把试制中的操作问题、工序关系和改善建议连接起来。重点是解释时间花在哪里，以及后续如何验证改善。": "Using the Y-axis subassembly as a specific case, I connected operational issues, process dependencies and improvement recommendations from the assembly trial. The focus was to explain where time was spent and how subsequent improvements could be verified.",
  "01 以实际动作拆解装配过程": "01 Break down the actual assembly tasks",
  "Y 轴子组件涉及光轴与轴承装入、皮带路径与张紧、零件定位和螺钉紧固。我围绕这些连续动作进行测时和问题记录，观察反复对齐、重新调整与工具切换发生的位置。整理时将装配动作与工位交接放在一起看，避免把等待、返工和直接操作时间混为同一个问题。": "The Y-axis subassembly involves installing guide rods and bearings, routing and tensioning the belt, locating parts and tightening screws. I timed these consecutive tasks and recorded issues, noting where repeated alignment, readjustment and tool changes occurred. I considered assembly tasks alongside workstation handoffs to distinguish waiting, rework and direct operation time.",
  "02 从现象追到可装配性问题": "02 Trace observations to assembly design issues",
  "定位不便可能与导入结构、配合公差或操作空间有关；紧固后运动不顺畅，则需要重新检查定位与紧固顺序。我的分析围绕定位、公差、紧固和工具配置展开，并据此讨论定位辅助、结构导入、固定工具配置、扭矩要求和工位任务重分配等方向。": "Difficult locating may relate to lead-in features, fit tolerances or access space. Restricted movement after fastening calls for a review of the locating and fastening sequence. My analysis covered locating, tolerances, fastening and tool setup, informing discussion of locating aids, assembly lead-ins, dedicated tool setups, torque requirements and workstation task reallocation.",
  "03 把经验整理成可重复执行的要求": "03 Turn observations into repeatable work requirements",
  "参与编制的工作指导书和技术报告承接了现场记录与改善讨论。复盘时，我把标准作业理解为操作顺序、关键检查点和工位交接要求的组合。52.65 分钟是本次整线总装配时间基线；是否改善仍需复测各工位时间、等待、返工及装配一致性。": "The work instructions and technical report I helped prepare drew on workshop records and improvement discussions. In my review, I treated standard work as a combination of operation sequences, key inspection points and workstation handover requirements. The 52.65-minute figure is the baseline total line assembly time for this trial. Any improvement still needs to be verified by remeasuring workstation times, waiting, rework and assembly consistency.",
