  "先判断测量数据是否可信，再分析尺寸能力与失效寿命；把“尺寸更稳定”和“产品更耐用”作为两个需要分别验证的问题。": "First assess whether the measurement data are trustworthy, then analyse dimensional capability and failure life. More consistent dimensions and greater durability are treated as separate questions requiring separate validation.",
  "个人报告包含检验定义、交叉 Gage R&R、尺寸能力分析、过程 FMEA 与鱼骨图，以及新旧铰链的寿命比较。": "My individual report covers inspection definitions, crossed Gage R&R, dimensional capability analysis, process FMEA and a fishbone diagram, plus a life comparison of the original and new hinges.",
  "三项尺寸 MSA、过程能力分析、FMEA / 鱼骨图及新旧批次寿命比较。": "MSA for three dimensions, process capability analysis, FMEA / fishbone analysis and a life comparison of the original and new batches.",
