  "先验证量具，再评价工艺": "Validate the Measurement System Before the Process",
  "对 10 个零件，由 3 名操作者各重复测量 3 次，使用 Minitab 交叉 Gage R&R 分析厚度、宽度与长度。厚度测量可用，宽度与长度的测量误差较大，需要优先改进定位、操作方法与重复性。": "For 10 parts, 3 operators each took 3 repeated measurements. Minitab crossed Gage R&R was used to analyse thickness, width and length. The thickness measurement system was usable; width and length had greater measurement error, so locating, measurement methods and repeatability needed priority attention.",
