  "厚度 Ppk≈0.35、Cpk≈0.27，提示样本过程能力不足。结合打印过程图、FMEA 与鱼骨图，讨论切片参数、材料干燥、温控、定位与作业指导书等改善方向。": "Thickness Ppk≈0.35 and Cpk≈0.27 indicated insufficient process capability in the sample. The printing process map, FMEA and fishbone diagram supported discussion of improvements to slicing parameters, material drying, temperature control, locating and work instructions.",
