  "每组 10 件的寿命数据呈现不同失效形态：旧批次有早期失效与长寿命尾部，新批次寿命更集中。两参数 Weibull 拟合中，新批次 B10 较高，但平均寿命估计较低，不能概括为整体可靠性全面提升。": "The life data, with 10 parts per group, showed different failure patterns: the original batch had early failures and a long-life tail, while the new batch had a more concentrated life distribution. In the two-parameter Weibull fits, the new batch had a higher B10 but a lower estimated mean life. These results do not establish an improvement in overall reliability.",
