  "方案边界与复盘": "Scope & Review",
  "课程现场未在规定时间内跑完全部 30 周，报告记录了事后补算。作品集因此展示决策框架、瓶颈分析和改进建议，不使用未经统一核验的总利润或提升率。": "The group did not complete all 30 weeks within the allotted workshop time, and the report records subsequent calculations. This portfolio therefore presents the decision framework, bottleneck analysis and improvement recommendations, without using overall profit or improvement rates that have not been consistently verified.",
  "动态参数优化、智能排程和自动化数据接口属于后续建议，现有报告没有证明这些功能已实现。": "Dynamic parameter optimisation, intelligent scheduling and automated data interfaces are recommendations for future work. The existing report does not demonstrate that these functions were implemented.",
  "模型和利润表为小组成果，个人分工见 PDF 第 3 页。本案例重点展示生产决策框架、约束分析与模型复盘。": "The model and profit tables are group outputs; see PDF p. 3 for individual contributions. This case focuses on the production decision framework, constraint analysis and model review.",
