  "成本估算的使用方式": "Using the cost estimates",
  "报告按材料质量、设备小时费、加工时间和模具摊销估算单件成本。这些数字适合解释方案之间的成本组成，实际选型仍需统一批量、材料报价、模具寿命和良率条件。": "The report estimates unit cost from material mass, equipment hourly rates, processing time and amortised tooling costs. These figures help explain the cost components of each proposal; actual selection still requires a consistent basis for production volume, material quotations, mould life and yield.",
  "强度和安全系数需要有完整载荷与约束依据。本页保留设计思路与可核实结构参数，不将原报告中的简化强度估算作为已经通过工程验证的结论。": "Strength and safety-factor assessments require fully defined loads and constraints. This page retains the design rationale and verifiable geometric parameters, without presenting the original report’s simplified strength estimates as conclusions that have passed engineering validation.",
  "图中为课程设计模型。制造成本为估算；CNC、注塑与钣金方案不等同于已经完成量产验证。": "The figures show course design models. Manufacturing costs are estimates; the CNC, injection-moulding and sheet metal proposals have not been validated for volume production.",
  "CNC 设计：PDF 2–5 页 ": "CNC design: PDF pp. 2–5 ",
