  "← 五类工艺与尺寸偏差": "← Five Processes and Dimensional Variation",
  "Capstone 矿区现场探测 →": "Capstone Mine-Site Survey →",
  "GPR 与 EM Loupe 矿区工程探测": "GPR and EM Loupe Mine-Site Investigation",
  "Capstone 项目 · 项目负责人": "Capstone project · Project leader",
  "从场地沟通、设备准备走到矿区现场采集与综合解释，使用互补探测方法评估浅层结构与电导率变化。": "From site coordination and equipment preparation to mine-site data collection and integrated interpretation, used complementary survey methods to assess shallow structures and conductivity changes.",
  "我担任 Capstone 项目负责人，负责与矿业单位对接并推进 Costerfield Mine 现场测试安排，参与设备准备、数据采集、整理、综合解释与报告展示。": "As Capstone project leader, I coordinated with the mining organisation and progressed field-test arrangements at Costerfield Mine. I also contributed to equipment preparation, data collection and organisation, integrated interpretation, reporting and presentations.",
  "项目现场协调与测试安排、测线数据、雷达剖面、电导率图和团队综合报告。": "Site coordination and test arrangements, survey-line data, radar profiles, conductivity maps and an integrated team report.",
  "Costerfield 研究区域": "Costerfield study area",
  "GPR 剖面与有效 EM 测线": "GPR profiles and usable EM survey lines",
  "矿区 GPR 天线频率": "Mine-site GPR antenna frequency",
  "现场实施": "Fieldwork",
  "团队先在 Royal Park 练习设备与数据流程，再进入 Costerfield 开展调查。现场需兼顾安全、可达性、天气、测线覆盖与电磁干扰，并保持测线方向和设备几何关系一致。": "The team practised equipment use and data workflows at Royal Park before surveying Costerfield. Fieldwork required consideration of safety, access, weather, survey coverage and electromagnetic interference, while maintaining consistent survey-line directions and equipment geometry.",
  "数据与解释": "Data and interpretation",
  "GPR 用于浅层反射剖面，EM Loupe 用于较深范围的电导率分布。团队完成数据整理、GPR 基础处理及电导率深度成像，结合两种方法形成初步地下分层解释。": "GPR provided shallow reflection profiles, while EM Loupe mapped conductivity over a greater depth range. The team organised the data, performed basic GPR processing and generated conductivity-depth images, combining both methods to develop a preliminary interpretation of subsurface layering.",
  "放大：矿区 GPR 现场采集，小组报告 PDF 第 17 页。": "Enlarge: Mine-site GPR data collection, team report PDF p. 17.",
  "矿区 GPR 现场采集，小组报告 PDF 第 17 页。": "Mine-site GPR data collection, team report PDF p. 17.",
  "放大：矿区 GPR 剖面解释图，PDF 第 30 页。": "Enlarge: Interpreted mine-site GPR profile, PDF p. 30.",
  "矿区 GPR 剖面解释图，PDF 第 30 页。": "Interpreted mine-site GPR profile, PDF p. 30.",
  "项目负责人的现场组织与技术衔接": "Field coordination and technical integration as project leader",
  "我担任 Capstone 项目负责人，负责矿业单位对接和现场测试安排，并参与采集、数据整理、综合解释与报告展示。": "As Capstone project leader, I coordinated with the mining organisation and arranged field testing, while contributing to data collection and organisation, integrated interpretation, reporting and presentations.",
  "01 项目组织：从练习场地走向矿区": "01 Project coordination: from practice site to mine site",
  "团队先在 Royal Park 熟悉设备、测线采集、记录和数据检查，再进入 Costerfield Mine 开展现场调查。作为项目负责人，我负责与矿业单位联系并推进测试目的、设备和人员入场等安排。现场组织需要同时考虑安全、可达性、天气、测线覆盖和设备配合，保证后续数据具有可解释的现场背景。": "The team first became familiar with the equipment, survey-line acquisition, recordkeeping and data checks at Royal Park, then conducted field surveys at Costerfield Mine. As project leader, I liaised with the mining organisation and progressed arrangements for test objectives, equipment and personnel access. Field coordination had to account for safety, access, weather, survey coverage and equipment coordination together, so that the data could be interpreted in its field context.",
  "02 技术衔接：两类方法提供互补证据": "02 Technical integration: complementary evidence from two methods",
  "团队使用 EKKO Project 整理 GPR 数据，进行时零校正、去低频漂移、背景去除、增益及波速拟合等处理。EM Loupe 数据通过 dsQC、EmaxAir 与 OriginPro 完成格式转换、反演和电导率可视化。GPR 用于浅层反射结构，EM 提供更大范围的电导率背景；这些处理与解释为团队共同成果。": "The team used EKKO Project to organise GPR data and perform time-zero correction, dewow filtering, background removal, gain adjustment and velocity fitting. EM Loupe data were processed using dsQC, EmaxAir and OriginPro for format conversion, inversion and conductivity visualisation. GPR characterised shallow reflection structures, while EM provided a broader conductivity context. Processing and interpretation were shared team outcomes.",
  "03 交付与判断：同时交代发现和限制": "03 Reporting and judgement: findings alongside limitations",
  "矿区有效成果包括 2 条 GPR 剖面和 18 条 EM 测线。我参与测试、数据整理、初步解释及报告展示，将现场条件与处理结果接回调查目的。GPR 主要讨论约上部 10 m 的结构，EM 主要解释约 50 m 以上范围；缺少沿线钻孔或取样验证，因此异常不能直接写成已发现矿体。": "The usable mine-site results comprised 2 GPR profiles and 18 EM survey lines. I contributed to testing, data organisation, preliminary interpretation, reporting and presentations, connecting field conditions and processed results back to the survey objectives. GPR interpretation focused on approximately the upper 10 m, and EM interpretation mainly on the upper 50 m. With no borehole or sampling verification along the survey lines, anomalies cannot be described as confirmed ore-body discoveries.",
