  "SLCA 比较中国铁路、中国公路和印度公路运输情景；LCC 与生态设计报告进一步比较太阳能供电、再生 ABS 和延长寿命三种方向。在既定模型假设下，太阳能方案在多数环境指标上表现较好，但其供电能力与耐久性仍需产品测试支持。": "SLCA compares rail transport in China, road transport in China and road transport in India. The LCC and ecodesign report further compares solar power, recycled ABS and a longer service life. Under the model's assumptions, the solar option performs better on most environmental indicators, but its power delivery and durability still require product testing.",
