  "质量距离单位、边界和数据库一致性": "Consistent mass–distance units, boundaries and databases",
  "成本与解释纪律": "Cost and interpretation",
  "成本框架包含材料、制造、运输、使用和报废，并使用折现思路比较全寿命支出。原报告折现表和部分汇总存在需复核的算术口径，因此本页不把总成本作为确定报价。": "The cost framework includes materials, manufacturing, transport, use and end-of-life treatment, using discounting to compare expenditure over the full life cycle. The original report's discounting table and some totals contain calculation issues that require checking, so this page does not present the total cost as a definitive quotation.",
  "运输占比依据附表 A.2 重新计算约为 0.51%，不沿用正文中的 0.05%。不同环境影响指标单位不同，本页逐项解释，不把异量纲指标直接相加成为综合评分。": "The transport share is recalculated from Appendix A.2 as approximately 0.51%, rather than the 0.05% stated in the main text. Environmental impact indicators have different units; this page explains them individually and does not add indicators with different dimensions into an overall score.",
  "环境影响为课程模型估计；材料数据库、运输边界、使用寿命与供电假设都会改变结果，尚未形成商业产品认证或实际减排业绩。": "Environmental impacts are estimates from a coursework model. The material database, transport boundary, service life and power supply assumptions all affect the results. The study does not establish commercial product certification or demonstrated emissions reductions.",
